# Node Structure

- `nodes/Arca/Arca.node.ts` — main node with resources and operations
- `nodes/ArcaTrigger/ArcaTrigger.node.ts` — trigger node
- `credentials/` — API key credential type
- Resources in `nodes/Arca/resources/` (Workspaces, Tasks, Lists, etc.)
- Operations in `nodes/Arca/operations/` grouped by resource

Follow n8n community node conventions:

- Resource/operation naming matches n8n patterns
- Use `baseUrl.ts` for API base URL configuration
- Operation files export display options and execute logic per resource
